  "id": "dynamical/asos-parquet",
  "title": "Global Airport Weather GeoParquet (1940-present)",
  "description": "Historical and near-real-time surface weather observations from global ASOS and AWOS airport stations, spanning 1940 to present with approximately 1.8 billion records. Each row captures a decoded METAR report including temperature, dewpoint, wind speed and direction, precipitation, visibility, and atmospheric pressure in both imperial and metric units. Station name, elevation, and point geometry are embedded in each record.",
